status	Show service status
up	Start a service
down	Stop a service
restart	Restart a service
once	Start once, without restarting
check	Check that a service is up
start	Start, then wait until it runs
stop	Stop, then wait until it is down
reload	Send HUP
kill	Send KILL
term	Send TERM
* ... @services	Service
-v	Wait for the change and report
-w	Seconds to wait with -v
